        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental state examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Speech normal in rate and volume, slightly pressured when discussing health worries. Mood described as worried; affect anxious, congruent and reactive. Thought form linear but perseverative on health worries; prominent health anxiety about cancer and dementia. No delusions or hallucinations reported. Denies suicidal ideation and self-harm thoughts; no homicidal ideation."
      }
